一次 fp-* 开关三方契约审计（策略下发 / 渲染进程转发白名单 / blink 消费）没有找到
真缺口，七条疑似全部被反驳 —— 我怀疑的那些「缺口」都是在错误的进程里找读取点：
fp-active / fp-shell / fp-passkey / fp-brand / fp-platform-version 都是浏览器侧
消费（UA-CH metadata 走 mojo 下发，WebAuthn 的认证器选择全在浏览器进程），按设计
就不进转发白名单。

但反驳过程掉出两处真问题，都是「误导下一个人」而非功能缺陷：

1. kDoNotTrackSwitch = "fp-do-not-track" 是死常量：全树只有那一行声明，既不下发
   也无人读，策略结构体里压根没有 DNT 字段。删掉不是因为它没用，而是因为它指向
   错误的做法 —— DNT 走的是 pref 通路，`DNT: 1` 请求头由浏览器进程按
   RendererPreferences 添加。谁按这个渲染侧开关把它接上，就会得到
   navigator.doNotTrack === "1" 而请求头不带 DNT：JS 说一套、线上做另一套，正是
   那种阳性矛盾。理由留在原地，免得下次有人用同样的方式再加回来。

2. authenticator_environment.cc 的注释称 fp-passkey「propagated to renderers
   alongside the other fp-* switches」—— 它从未被转发，也不需要转发（第 36 行读的
   是浏览器进程自己的 ForCurrentProcess()）。注释误述了自身机制。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 content/browser/webauth/authenticator_environment.cc | 12 ++++++++++--
 .../fingerbrowser/fingerbrowser_fingerprint.h        |  9 ++++++++-
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/content/browser/webauth/authenticator_environment.cc b/content/browser/webauth/authenticator_environment.cc
index 172bce0790..a4b2df26d9 100644
--- a/content/browser/webauth/authenticator_environment.cc
+++ b/content/browser/webauth/authenticator_environment.cc
@@ -28,8 +28,16 @@ namespace {
 
 // FingerBrowser: enables the per-environment software passkey authenticator.
 // Emitted by chrome/browser/fingerbrowser/fingerbrowser_policy.cc from the
-// profile's policy file, and propagated to renderers alongside the other fp-*
-// switches.
+// profile's policy file.
+//
+// Unlike the fp-* switches that feed JS-visible getters, this one is NOT in the
+// renderer propagation list in render_process_host_impl.cc, and must not be
+// added to it: authenticator discovery and selection happen entirely in the
+// browser process, so the read below is ForCurrentProcess() on the same process
+// that ApplyFingerBrowserPolicy wrote to. Blink's navigator.credentials only
+// forwards the request over blink::mojom::Authenticator and would have no use
+// for the switch. (An earlier version of this comment claimed the switch was
+// propagated to renderers -- it never was, and does not need to be.)
 constexpr char kFingerBrowserPasskeySwitch[] = "fp-passkey";
 
 bool FingerBrowserPasskeyEnabled() {
diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/fingerbrowser/fingerbrowser_fingerprint.h b/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/fingerbrowser/fingerbrowser_fingerprint.h
index 6c2e4f12ec..44441f08de 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/fingerbrowser/fingerbrowser_fingerprint.h
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/fingerbrowser/fingerbrowser_fingerprint.h
@@ -67,7 +67,14 @@ inline constexpr char kDevicePixelRatioX1000Switch[] = "fp-dpr-x1000";
 // pointer:coarse 为否——这三者本该同进同退，对不上同样是阳性证据。
 // 传 0 表示无触摸（桌面人格）。
 inline constexpr char kMaxTouchPointsSwitch[] = "fp-max-touch-points";
-inline constexpr char kDoNotTrackSwitch[] = "fp-do-not-track";
+// 这里曾有一个 kDoNotTrackSwitch = "fp-do-not-track"。它从未被下发、也从未被读取
+// ——全树只有那一行声明。删掉不是因为它没用，而是因为**它指向错误的做法**：
+// DNT 走的是 pref 通路（renderer_preferences_util.cc 把 prefs::kEnableDoNotTrack
+// 填进 RendererPreferences），navigator.doNotTrack 由 local_frame_client_impl 读
+// 该字段，而 `DNT: 1` 请求头是**浏览器进程**在 browser_initiated_resource_request.cc
+// 里按同一字段加的。谁要是按一个渲染侧开关把它接上，就会得到
+// navigator.doNotTrack === "1" 而请求头不带 DNT ——JS 说一套、线上做另一套，
+// 正是那种阳性矛盾。将来做 DNT 请设 pref，不要在这里加开关。
 // 经纬度以 1e6 倍整数传递（命令行开关只走整数解析，避免浮点字符串的本地化问题）。
 inline constexpr char kGeoLatitudeE6Switch[] = "fp-geo-lat-e6";
 inline constexpr char kGeoLongitudeE6Switch[] = "fp-geo-lon-e6";
